{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Other discrete symmetries: parity-type relations t_a(u) ↔ t_b(c − u)\n\n**Question (Paul).** Besides LR (t̄₁(u) ↔ t̄₃(u+h)), are there symmetric states of u → −u type, t_a(u) = t_a(c−u) or t_a(u) = t_{4−a}(c−u)? And are there product states preserving them?\n\nKnown operators (`abjm-LR-symmetry.wb`): 𝒫 = Weyl∘(one-site shift), 𝒫 t̄₁(u)𝒫⁻¹ = t̄₃(u+h); 𝒬 = (signed Weyl)∘(reflection), 𝒬 t̄₁(u)𝒬⁻¹ = t̄₁(2h−u). Hence 𝒫𝒬: t̄₁(u) → t̄₃(3h−u). Three state conditions:\n\n| name | condition | operator |\n|---|---|---|\n| LR | τ̄₁(u) = τ̄₃(u + c) | 𝒫 |\n| P (parity) | τ̄₁(u) = τ̄₁(c − u) | 𝒬 |\n| LP | τ̄₁(u) = τ̄₃(c − u) | 𝒫𝒬 |\n\n**Part 1** tests these on the saved eigenvalue polynomials of all 184 states (c fitted from the two leading coefficients, then the full polynomial identity checked), plus τ̄₂(u) = τ̄₂(c−u), and translates to Q-functions. **Part 2** (L = 2, exact): left kernels of the corresponding difference operators and product-state search, untwisted and twisted.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "dataDir = \"c:\\\\Users\\\\pryan\\\\git-projects\\\\abjm-c123\\\\Paul\\\\Mathematica\\\\su4-alternating\\\\data\";\ntau = Import[FileNameJoin[{dataDir, \"abjm-tau.wxf\"}], \"WXF\"]; sts = Import[FileNameJoin[{dataDir, \"abjm-hw-states.wxf\"}], \"WXF\"]; qfs = Import[FileNameJoin[{dataDir, \"abjm-Qfunctions.wxf\"}], \"WXF\"];\nhh = 1/2;\n(* p_A(u) = p_B(c - u)?  (sign = -1)   or  p_A(u) = p_B(u + c)?  (sign = +1); c from the u^(n-1) coefficient *)\nrelFit[cA_, cB_, sign_] := Module[{n = Length[cA] - 1, c, x, pa, pb, d},\n   c = If[sign == -1, -(cA[[n]] + cB[[n]])/(n cB[[n + 1]]), (cA[[n]] - cB[[n]])/(n cB[[n + 1]])];\n   pa = cA . x^Range[0, n]; pb = cB . (If[sign == -1, c - x, x + c])^Range[0, n];\n   d = CoefficientList[Expand[pa - pb], x];\n   {Chop[c, 10^-9], Max[Abs[d]]/Max[Abs[cA]]}];\nsymRow[tc_, st_] := Module[{lr = relFit[tc[[1]], tc[[3]], 1], p = relFit[tc[[1]], tc[[1]], -1], lp = relFit[tc[[1]], tc[[3]], -1], p2 = relFit[tc[[2]], tc[[2]], -1]},\n   <|\"dyn\" -> st[\"dyn\"], \"E\" -> st[\"E\"], \"LR\" -> lr, \"P\" -> p, \"LP\" -> lp, \"P2\" -> p2|>];\nsym = Association[Table[\"L\" <> ToString[L] -> MapThread[symRow, {tau[\"L\" <> ToString[L]], sts[\"L\" <> ToString[L]]}], {L, {2, 3, 4}}]];\nok[r_] := r[[2]] < 10^-8;\nsumSym = Table[With[{rows = sym[\"L\" <> ToString[L]]},\n    {L, Length[rows], Count[rows, r_ /; ok[r[\"LR\"]]], Count[rows, r_ /; ok[r[\"P\"]]], Count[rows, r_ /; ok[r[\"LP\"]]], Count[rows, r_ /; ok[r[\"P2\"]]],\n     Count[rows, r_ /; ok[r[\"LR\"]] && ok[r[\"P\"]]], Count[rows, r_ /; !ok[r[\"LR\"]] && !ok[r[\"P\"]] && !ok[r[\"LP\"]]],\n     Union[Cases[rows, r_ /; ok[r[\"LR\"]] :> r[\"LR\"][[1]]]], Union[Cases[rows, r_ /; ok[r[\"P\"]] :> Round[r[\"P\"][[1]], 10.^-8]]], Union[Cases[rows, r_ /; ok[r[\"LP\"]] :> Round[r[\"LP\"][[1]], 10.^-8]]]}], {L, {2, 3, 4}}];\nGrid[Prepend[sumSym, {\"L\", \"# states\", \"# LR\", \"# P\", \"# LP\", \"# with τ̄₂(u)=τ̄₂(c−u)\", \"# LR and P (⇒ all three)\", \"# none\", \"c (LR)\", \"c (P)\", \"c (LP)\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"72\" data-out-n=\"714\" data-sub-idx=\"9\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"17\" data-sub-end=\"17\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[714]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"wolfbook-render-error\" style=\"color:#cc0000;font-family:monospace;white-space:pre-wrap\">[LaTeX error] KaTeX parse error: Expected &#39;$&#39;, got &#39;$̄&#39; at position 138: …t{\\# with $\\tau$̲̲̄₂(u)=$\\tau$̄₂(c…<br><small>\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{L} &amp; \\text{\\# states} &amp; \\text{\\# LR} &amp; \\text{\\# P} &amp; \\text{\\# LP} &amp; \\text{\\# with $\\tau$̄₂(u)=$\\tau$̄₂(c−u)} &amp; \\text{\\# LR and P ($\\Rightarrow$ all three)} &amp; \\text{\\# none} &amp; \\text{c (LR)} &amp; \\text{c (P)} &amp; \\text{c (LP)}\\\\\\hline2 &amp; 6 &amp; 4 &amp; 6 &amp; 4 &amp; 6 &amp; 4 &amp; 0 &amp; \\left\\{0.49999999999999967,0.4999999999999998\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{1.\\,\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{1.5\\right\\}\\\\\\hline3 &amp; 26 &amp; 8 &amp; 18 &amp; 12 &amp; 22 &amp; 8 &amp; 4 &amp; \\left\\{0.5000000000000013,0.5000000000000014,0.5000000000000018,0.5000000000000021,0.5000000000000023,0.5000000000000027,0.5000000000000029\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{1.\\,\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{1.5\\right\\}\\\\\\hline4 &amp; 152 &amp; 24 &amp; 60 &amp; 40 &amp; 80 &amp; 20 &amp; 68 &amp; \\left\\{0.499999999999991,0.49999999999999667,0.4999999999999971,0.49999999999999795,0.4999999999999981,0.49999999999999833,0.49999999999999845,0.49999999999999856,0.49999999999999867,0.499999999999999,0.49999999999999933,0.5,0.5000000000000007,0.5000000000000013,0.5000000000000031,0.5000000000000032,0.5000000000000037,0.5000000000000039,0.500000000000005,0.5000000000000054,0.5000000000000077\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{1.\\,\\right\\} &amp; \\left\\{1.5\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}</small></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[714]= \\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{L} & \\text{\\# states} & \\text{\\# LR} & \\text{\\# P} & \\text{\\# LP} & \\text{\\# with $\\tau$̄₂(u)=$\\tau$̄₂(c−u)} & \\text{\\# LR and P ($\\Rightarrow$ all three)} & \\text{\\# none} & \\text{c (LR)} & \\text{c (P)} & \\text{c (LP)}\\\\\\hline2 & 6 & 4 & 6 & 4 & 6 & 4 & 0 & \\left\\{0.49999999999999967,0.4999999999999998\\right\\} & \\left\\{1.\\,\\right\\} & \\left\\{1.5\\right\\}\\\\\\hline3 & 26 & 8 & 18 & 12 & 22 & 8 & 4 & \\left\\{0.5000000000000013,0.5000000000000014,0.5000000000000018,0.5000000000000021,0.5000000000000023,0.5000000000000027,0.5000000000000029\\right\\} & \\left\\{1.\\,\\right\\} & \\left\\{1.5\\right\\}\\\\\\hline4 & 152 & 24 & 60 & 40 & 80 & 20 & 68 & \\left\\{0.499999999999991,0.49999999999999667,0.4999999999999971,0.49999999999999795,0.4999999999999981,0.49999999999999833,0.49999999999999845,0.49999999999999856,0.49999999999999867,0.499999999999999,0.49999999999999933,0.5,0.5000000000000007,0.5000000000000013,0.5000000000000031,0.5000000000000032,0.5000000000000037,0.5000000000000039,0.500000000000005,0.5000000000000054,0.5000000000000077\\right\\} & \\left\\{1.\\,\\right\\} & \\left\\{1.5\\right\\}\\\\\\hline\\end{array}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "fc1d5794-4761-4fcb-aa71-1d0212ff1f46"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result:** all three kinds of symmetric states exist, with universal points: **LR: τ̄₁(u) = τ̄₃(u + h); P: τ̄₁(u) = τ̄₁(2h − u); LP: τ̄₁(u) = τ̄₃(3h − u)** (c fitted per state, identical for all symmetric states; polynomial identities exact to 10⁻⁸ relative). τ̄₂(u) = τ̄₂(c − u) holds exactly for the P and the LP states (𝒫 maps t̄₂ to itself).\n\n### Classes and Q-function form\n\nQ-language: P ⇔ Q₁(u) ∝ Q₁(c₁ − u) (roots of Q₁ symmetric), LP ⇔ Q₁(u) ∝ Q₁₂₃(c₂ − u); LR ⇔ Q₁(u) ∝ Q₁₂₃(u + h) (`abjm-Qfunctions.wb`). Check against the τ classification and read off c₁, c₂.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "classOf[r_] := Switch[{ok[r[\"LR\"]], ok[r[\"P\"]], ok[r[\"LP\"]]}, {True, True, True}, \"all three\", {True, False, False}, \"LR only\", {False, True, False}, \"P only\", {False, False, True}, \"LP only\", {False, False, False}, \"none\", _, \"inconsistent\"];\nclassTab = Table[With[{rows = sym[\"L\" <> ToString[L]]}, Prepend[Table[Count[rows, r_ /; classOf[r] == k], {k, {\"all three\", \"LR only\", \"P only\", \"LP only\", \"none\", \"inconsistent\"}}], L]], {L, {2, 3, 4}}];\n(* Q-language: roots of Q1 symmetric about c1/2;  roots of Q1 = c2 - roots of Q123 *)\nqP[q_] := Module[{r = q[\"roots\"][[1]], c}, If[r === {}, {Null, 0.}, c = 2 Mean[r]; {Chop[c, 10^-8], Max[Table[Min[Abs[r - (c - s)]], {s, r}]]}]];\nqLP[q_] := Module[{r1 = q[\"roots\"][[1]], r3 = q[\"roots\"][[3]], c}, Which[Length[r1] != Length[r3], {Null, Infinity}, r1 === {}, {Null, 0.}, True, c = Mean[r1] + Mean[r3]; {Chop[c, 10^-8], Max[Table[Min[Abs[r1 - (c - s)]], {s, r3}]]}]];\nqAgree = Table[With[{rows = sym[\"L\" <> ToString[L]], qs = qfs[\"L\" <> ToString[L]]},\n    {L, Count[Transpose[{rows, qs}], {r_, q_} /; ok[r[\"P\"]] == (qP[q][[2]] < 10^-6)], Count[Transpose[{rows, qs}], {r_, q_} /; ok[r[\"LP\"]] == (qLP[q][[2]] < 10^-6)],\n     Union[DeleteCases[Cases[Transpose[{rows, qs}], {r_, q_} /; ok[r[\"P\"]] :> Round[qP[q][[1]], 10.^-6]], Null]],\n     Union[DeleteCases[Cases[Transpose[{rows, qs}], {r_, q_} /; ok[r[\"LP\"]] :> Round[qLP[q][[1]], 10.^-6]], Null]]}], {L, {2, 3, 4}}];\nColumn[{Grid[Prepend[classTab, {\"L\", \"all three\", \"LR only\", \"P only\", \"LP only\", \"none\", \"inconsistent\"}], Frame -> All],\n  Grid[Prepend[qAgree, {\"L\", \"# where τ-P = Q-P\", \"# where τ-LP = Q-LP\", \"c₁ (Q₁(u) = Q₁(c₁−u))\", \"c₂ (Q₁(u) = Q₁₂₃(c₂−u))\"}], Frame -> All]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"825950\" data-output-id=\"73\" data-out-n=\"720\" data-sub-idx=\"6\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"3\" data-sub-start=\"9\" data-sub-end=\"10\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[720]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"15\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:9.71em;vertical-align:-4.605em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.105em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.12em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.705em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.65em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">L</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">all three</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">LR only</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:4.8em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-2.15em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.65em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">P only</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">40</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"wi