  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result (L = 2, untwisted):** dim ker X_P = 136, dim ker X_LP = 196. Unlike LR, **all 40 starts reach product states in both kernels, none of them an eigen-bra**, all different. The P solutions have v₁ ∥ v₃ and v₂ ∥ v₄ with generic pairings v_A·v_F ≠ 0: two-site periodic states (v ⊗ w)^{⊗L}.\n\n### Conjecture check: generic two-site states, L = 2, 3, 4\n\nB = (v ⊗ w)^{⊗L} with random v (A) and w (F). Test ‖B·X(u)r‖/‖B‖‖X(u)r‖ for random kets r and three u values (one-pass transfer matrices, vector form), for X_P, X_LP and X_LR. Also the structure of the LP solutions at L = 2.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "lax2dummy = Null;\napplySite[psi_, s_, m_, L_] := Module[{A = ArrayReshape[psi, {nn^(s - 1), nn, nn^(L - s)}], R, nz},\n   nz = Select[Flatten[Table[{i, j, m[[i, j]]}, {i, nn}, {j, nn}], 1], #[[3]] != 0 &]; R = 0. A;\n   Do[R[[All, r[[1]], All]] += r[[3]] A[[All, r[[2]], All]], {r, nz}]; Flatten[R]];\ntypesOf[LL_] := Flatten[Table[{\"A\", \"F\"}, LL/2]];\ntransferV[lax_, LL_, ths_, v_, psi_] := Module[{tys = typesOf[LL], Phi, mat},\n   mat[s_, i_, j_] := N[Normal[lax[tys[[s]]][v, ths[[s]]][i, j]]];\n   Phi = Table[applySite[psi, LL, mat[LL, k, j], LL], {k, nn}, {j, nn}];\n   Do[Phi = Table[Sum[applySite[Phi[[m, j]], s, mat[s, k, m], LL], {m, nn}], {k, nn}, {j, nn}], {s, LL - 1, 1, -1}];\n   Sum[Phi[[i, i]], {i, nn}]];\nthAB[LL_] := N[Flatten[Table[{2 hh, 0}, LL/2]]];\nt1v[LL_][v_, r_] := transferV[lax1, LL, thAB[LL], v, r]; t3v[LL_][v_, r_] := transferV[lax3, LL, thAB[LL], v, r];\nXop[\"LR\", LL_][v_, r_] := t1v[LL][v, r] - t3v[LL][v + hh, r];\nXop[\"P\", LL_][v_, r_] := t1v[LL][v, r] - t1v[LL][2 hh - v, r];\nXop[\"LP\", LL_][v_, r_] := t1v[LL][v, r] - t3v[LL][3 hh - v, r];\ntwoSiteTest[LL_, kind_, seed_] := Module[{v, w, B, rs, us = {0.37, -0.61, 1.13}},\n   SeedRandom[seed]; v = RandomComplex[{-1 - I, 1 + I}, 4]; w = RandomComplex[{-1 - I, 1 + I}, 4];\n   B = Flatten[Outer[Times, Sequence @@ Flatten[Table[{v, w}, LL/2], 1]]];\n   rs = Table[RandomComplex[{-1 - I, 1 + I}, nn^LL], 2];\n   Max[Flatten[Table[With[{y = Xop[kind, LL][uu, r]}, Abs[B . y]/(Norm[B] Norm[y])], {uu, us}, {r, rs}]]]];\nlpStruct = Module[{Kon = Orthogonalize[N[KLP]], f, xs, sols}, SeedRandom[8];\n   f[x_?(VectorQ[#, NumericQ] &)] := With[{b = prodVec[x]}, 1 - Total[Abs[Conjugate[Kon] . b]^2]/Norm[b]^2];\n   sols = Table[xs /. Quiet[FindMinimum[f[xs], {xs, RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 32]}, Method -> \"QuasiNewton\", MaxIterations -> 3000]][[2]], {4}];\n   Table[Module[{vv = Normalize /@ Partition[s[[1 ;; 16]] + I s[[17 ;; 32]], 4]}, Round[{1 - Abs[Conjugate[vv[[1]]] . vv[[3]]], 1 - Abs[Conjugate[vv[[2]]] . vv[[4]]], 1 - Abs[vv[[1]] . vv[[4]]], 1 - Abs[vv[[2]] . vv[[3]]]}, 10.^-4]], {s, sols}]];\ntsRows = Table[{LL/2, kind, ScientificForm[Max[Table[twoSiteTest[LL, kind, sd], {sd, 3}]], 2]}, {LL, {4, 6, 8}}, {kind, {\"P\", \"LP\", \"LR\"}}];\nColumn[{Grid[Prepend[Flatten[tsRows, 1], {\"L\", \"symmetry\", \"max |B·X(u)r| (relative), 3 random two-site states\"}], Frame -> All],\n  Grid[Prepend[lpStruct, {\"1−|v₁·v₃| (herm.)\", \"1−|v₂·v₄|\", \"1−|v₁·v₄|\", \"1−|v₂·v₃|\"}], Frame -> All]}]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
