  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result:** every two-site state (v⊗w)^{⊗L} (random v, w) satisfies ⟨B|(t̄₁(u) − t̄₁(2h−u)) = 0 to 10⁻¹⁶ at L = 2, 3, 4; two-site states fail for LP and LR (10⁻²–10⁻³). The LP product solutions at L = 2 are not two-site periodic; instead v₄·v₁ = 0 and v₂·v₃ = 0 (bilinear): every **F→A link** is \"BPS-orthogonal\", the A→F links are free.\n\n### LP pattern check\n\nRandom product states with v_{2k}·v_{2k+1} = 0 for all k (F site ⟂ next A site, cyclically), the mirror pattern v_{2k−1}·v_{2k} = 0 (A ⟂ next F), and fully generic product states, tested against X_P, X_LP, X_LR.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "orthTo[w_, r_] := r - (w . r)/(w . w) w;\nlinkState[LL_, pattern_, seed_] := Module[{v = Table[0, LL]},\n   SeedRandom[seed];\n   Do[v[[s]] = RandomComplex[{-1 - I, 1 + I}, 4], {s, LL}];\n   Switch[pattern,\n    \"F⟂nextA\", Do[v[[s + 1]] = orthTo[v[[s]], v[[s + 1]]], {s, 2, LL - 2, 2}]; v[[1]] = Module[{a = v[[1]]}, a = orthTo[v[[LL]], a]; a],\n    \"A⟂nextF\", Do[v[[s + 1]] = orthTo[v[[s]], v[[s + 1]]], {s, 1, LL - 1, 2}],\n    \"generic\", Null];\n   Flatten[Outer[Times, Sequence @@ v]]];\nlinkTest[LL_, pattern_, kind_] := Max[Table[Module[{B = linkState[LL, pattern, sd], rs, us = {0.37, -0.61, 1.13}}, SeedRandom[100 + sd];\n     rs = Table[RandomComplex[{-1 - I, 1 + I}, nn^LL], 2];\n     Max[Flatten[Table[With[{y = Xop[kind, LL][uu, r]}, Abs[B . y]/(Norm[B] Norm[y])], {uu, us}, {r, rs}]]]], {sd, 3}]];\nlinkRows = Flatten[Table[{LL/2, pat, Sequence @@ (ScientificForm[linkTest[LL, pat, #], 2] & /@ {\"P\", \"LP\", \"LR\"})}, {LL, {4, 6, 8}}, {pat, {\"F⟂nextA\", \"A⟂nextF\", \"generic\"}}], 1];\nGrid[Prepend[linkRows, {\"L\", \"product state\", \"X_P\", \"X_LP\", \"X_LR\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
