   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "**Result:** generic product states in the SU(2)×SU(2) sector pass X_LP only at L = 2 (10⁻¹⁶) and fail at L = 3, 4 (10⁻²) — an L = 2 accident. Two-site states inside the sector pass all three, but trivially: a·f = 0, so (a⊗f)^{⊗L} is a BPS rotated vacuum. P is robust: **every two-site state (v⊗w)^{⊗L} with v·w ≠ 0 is P-annihilated** (L = 2, 3, 4).\n\n### L = 3 product-state searches (sketched kernel)\n\nCondition B·X(u)r = 0 imposed for 6 values of u (deg_u X ≤ 2L−1) and 15 random kets r (90 complex conditions on the 18-dim manifold of product states); y_jk = X(u_j)r_k precomputed, f(B) = Σ|B·y_jk|²/(‖B‖²Σ‖y_jk‖²). Zeros are verified with fresh kets and classified: BPS (all v_A·v_F = 0, A's parallel, F's parallel), two-site (v₁∥v₃∥v₅, v₂∥v₄∥v₆), or other.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "LL3 = 6; us6 = {0.37, -0.61, 1.13, -1.42, 0.83, 2.05};\nprodVecN[x_List, LL_] := Module[{c = x[[1 ;; 4 LL]] + I x[[4 LL + 1 ;; 8 LL]]}, Flatten[Outer[Times, Sequence @@ Partition[c, 4]]]];\nsketch[kind_, LL_, nk_, seed_] := Module[{rs}, SeedRandom[seed]; rs = Table[RandomComplex[{-1 - I, 1 + I}, nn^LL], nk]; Flatten[Table[Xop[kind, LL][uu, r], {uu, us6}, {r, rs}], 1]];\nsearch3[kind_, nStart_] := Module[{Y = sketch[kind, LL3, 15, 1], Yc, f, runs, verifyY = sketch[kind, LL3, 4, 2], zeros, cls},\n   f[x_?(VectorQ[#, NumericQ] &)] := With[{b = prodVecN[x, LL3]}, Total[Abs[Y . b]^2]/(Norm[b]^2 Total[Norm /@ Y]^2/Length[Y])];\n   SeedRandom[33];\n   runs = Table[Module[{x0 = RandomReal[{-1, 1}, 8 LL3], sol, xs}, sol = Quiet[FindMinimum[f[xs], {xs, x0}, Method -> \"QuasiNewton\", MaxIterations -> 5000]]; {sol[[1]], xs /. sol[[2]]}], {nStart}];\n   zeros = Select[runs, #[[1]] < 10^-14 &];\n   cls = Table[Module[{x = z[[2]], v, b, par, ver, bps, two},\n      v = Normalize /@ Partition[x[[1 ;; 24]] + I x[[25 ;; 48]], 4]; b = prodVecN[x, LL3];\n      par[p_, q_] := 1 - Abs[Conjugate[p] . q] < 10^-5;\n      ver = Max[Abs[verifyY . b]/(Norm[b] (Norm /@ verifyY))];\n      two = par[v[[1]], v[[3]]] && par[v[[3]], v[[5]]] && par[v[[2]], v[[4]]] && par[v[[4]], v[[6]]];\n      bps = two && Abs[v[[1]] . v[[2]]] < 10^-5;\n      {ver < 10^-6, Which[bps, \"BPS\", two, \"two-site\", True, \"other\"]}], {z, zeros}];\n   {Length[runs], Length[zeros], Tally[cls]}];\nres3 = Table[{kind, Sequence @@ search3[kind, 24]}, {kind, {\"LR\", \"P\", \"LP\"}}];\nGrid[Prepend[res3, {\"symmetry\", \"# starts\", \"# zeros (f < 10⁻¹⁴)\", \"{verified with fresh kets?, type}: tally\"}], Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  }
 ],
